{"id":"ni:///sha-256;BpUL8RPZMTVHwkzSrhAxcQD4vqnDlrnIA0n8oZf0wW8","observation":{"address":["mark","{\"a\":[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"requirements\\\"\"]],\"e\":[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"ni:///sha-256;KzHMM8Kk5gRT8XK5YPrr_zFrvmUYNLTp_gOSXjFOY80\\\"\"]],\"t\":\"2026-10-10T01:34:27.864Z\",\"v\":[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.object\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"address\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"ni:///sha-256;T6vA2IQOw6vMz2eHINoAJl0HD3JnSB8YI0RIR9azfco\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"body\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.object\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"after\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.array\\\"\"],[\"star\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"asks\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"Our goal in this session is to explore how the 561 Group is gaining a \\\\\\\"first mover advantage\\\\\\\" in, broadly, research and engineering of kinematics, but in practice this reflects as moving early into agentics; despite being a single individual without capital, we come with a tremendous body of knowledge informed by my experience and then validated mathematically.\\\\n\\\\nSo our key direction is research and application of relationality (kinematics), and using those to establish the 561 Group as the strongest organization in that field, and as a consequence, the only one approaching *other* fields from that perspective, basically looking \\\\\\\"backward\\\\\\\" from our futuristic science and engineering into the real world, while the 561 Group looks forward. (This lines up weirdly with our math: 561 Group sits at the boundary of necessary and potential, 561-group-services-section looking to potential, public-services-section looking to what's necessary, and this induces the unfolding of our science and engineering.)\\\\n\\\\nThis is all grounded in an significantly sophisticated set of resources you have access to, but the resources are early alpha \\\\\\\"vibeslop\\\\\\\" so part of our goal in this session is using this perspective of first-movers into kinematic space, providing quantum and classical knowledge backward, to help stabilize the 561 Group's internal imagination, mythopoetry, praxis.\\\\n\\\\nWe have so many wild ideas: UHC, ANT, SSE. Web as zeolite-siloxane vitrimers. Web as jiangshi.\\\\n\\\\nBut truly we want to take the day, as it is Theorsday, with full-throated conviction in our wildest ideas, and go, yup, that's who we are, those people with wild ideas, and we are going to do our fidicuary duty to ourselves to take being first movers into this world that others don't even know exists yet, seriously.\\\\n\\\\nThe space opened up by relationality and obsmetrologia - paraconsistent transfinitely-valued linear logic - is *massive*; like the difference between being stuck on earth, and being able to travel the stars.\\\\n\\\\nBut it's *information* space, so travel is instant, so it's even more mind-boggling.\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"carriedFrom\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/science-services-section/services/philosophy-services-section/services/relationality-services-section/content/requirements/relationality-kinematics-first-mover-direction.json\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"id\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"relationality-kinematics-first-mover-direction\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"kind\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"561-group.requirement.v1\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"metWhen\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.array\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.object\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"cell\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"kinematics:boundary-theory-stated\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"command\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"sh -c 'grep -l -i \\\\\\\"necessary\\\\\\\" lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/science-services-section/services/philosophy-services-section/services/relationality-services-section/content/text/documents/articles/notes/2026/10/*/*kinematics*first-mover*.md'\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"exercises\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"existence\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"expectedExit\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.number\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"0\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"says\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"A dated note states the boundary theory.\\\"\"]]],[\"star\"]]]]]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.object\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"cell\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"kinematics:backward-map\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"command\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"sh -c 'ls lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/science-services-section/services/philosophy-services-section/services/relationality-services-section/data/records/*kinematics*backward*.json >/dev/null 2>&1'\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"exercises\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"existence\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"expectedExit\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.number\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"0\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"says\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"A record maps fields to the knowledge carried backward.\\\"\"]]],[\"star\"]]]]]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.object\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"cel